# Data Dictionary (MTG Dashboard)

## Cards table (Scryfall)
- scryfall_id: Unique ID for each print (join key)
- oracle_id: Oracle ID shared across reprints
- name: Card name
- set / set_name: Set identifiers
- rarity: common/uncommon/rare/mythic
- released_at: Release date
- usd / usd_foil: Latest price fields from Scryfall
- image_normal: URL used to render card image in BI

## Deck table (Archidekt export)
- deck_name: Deck identifier
- card_name: Card name (as exported)
- scryfall_id / oracle_id: Join fields
- qty: Card quantity
- category: Functional category (ramp/removal/draw/etc.)
